# Build output — regenerated by pnpm build, never commit.
# Anchored to the repo root on purpose: a bare `lib/` also matches nested
# directories (scripts/lib/, src/anything/lib/), and it silently swallowed a
# build-time module that lived in scripts/lib/ — committed tree looked clean,
# and only the sandboxed CI rehearse clone failed (ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND).
# If a nested helper directory is ever wanted, add `!scripts/lib/` here.
/lib/
